---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Help Center
description: "Help for CoopCircle: guides for society leaders and staff using Coop Staff, and for members using Coop Member."
bodyClass: page-help
---
<section class="help-hero">
  <div class="container-xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Help Center</p>
    <h1 class="display-page">How can we help?</h1>
    {% include "partials/help-search.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pt-5">
  <div class="container-xl">
    <div class="help-doors">
      <a class="help-door" href="/help/staff/">
        <img src="/assets/img/brand/coopstaff-mark.svg" alt="" width="48" height="58">
        <span>
          <strong>I run or work for a society</strong>
          <span>Help with Coop Staff: setting up, members, payments, loans, reports and billing.</span>
        </span>
        {% icon "arrow-right" %}
      </a>
      <a class="help-door" href="/help/members/">
        <img src="/assets/img/brand/coopmember-mark.svg" alt="" width="48" height="58">
        <span>
          <strong>I’m a member</strong>
          <span>Help with Coop Member: joining, your PIN, paying in, loans and your account.</span>
        </span>
        {% icon "arrow-right" %}
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-5 mt-2">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Popular for staff</h2>
        <ul class="help-list">
          {%- for a in collections.helpStaff | popular %}<li><a href="{{ a.url }}">{{ a.data.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Popular for members</h2>
        <ul class="help-list">
          {%- for a in collections.helpMembers | popular %}<li><a href="{{ a.url }}">{{ a.data.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint">
  <div class="container-xl">
    <div class="help-contact">
      <div>
        <h2 class="h3">Can’t find what you need?</h2>
        <p>Members: your society’s staff can help with your balances and requests. For anything about CoopCircle itself, write to us.</p>
        <p>Not sure what a word means? See <a href="/help/words/">Words we use</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/?topic=help">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
